{
 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "一条消息过河",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 113.46,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.28,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 2.687
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "跨链桥，是在两条链之间转移资产或消息的系统。",
   "spoken": "跨链桥，是在两条链之间转移资产或消息的系统。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-01.wav",
   "start": 3.1,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 3.1,
   "speechEnd": 7.728
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "B 链上的合约，要相信 A 链上发生了某件事。",
   "spoken": "B 链上的合约，要相信 A 链上发生了某件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-02.wav",
   "start": 8.12,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 8.221,
   "speechEnd": 11.768
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "可 B 链看不到 A 链。它只能相信某种证明。",
   "spoken": "可 B 链看不到 A 链。它只能相信某种证明。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-03.wav",
   "start": 12.18,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 12.18,
   "speechEnd": 16.188
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "最常见的做法，叫锁定和铸造。",
   "spoken": "最常见的做法，叫锁定和铸造。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-04.wav",
   "start": 16.64,
   "dur": 2.88,
   "speechStart": 16.64,
   "speechEnd": 19.355
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "举个例子。用户在 A 链，把 100 USDT 存进桥合约，锁起来。",
   "spoken": "举个例子。用户在 A 链，把 100 USDT 存进桥合约，锁起来。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-05.wav",
   "start": 19.74,
   "dur": 5.84,
   "speechStart": 19.74,
   "speechEnd": 25.392
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "桥合约发出一条存款事件，写着用户、金额和一个序号。",
   "spoken": "桥合约发出一条存款事件，写着用户、金额和一个序号。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-06.wav",
   "start": 25.8,
   "dur": 6.16,
   "speechStart": 25.8,
   "speechEnd": 31.795
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "中继者观察 A 链，等这笔交易足够确定，不会再被回滚。",
   "spoken": "中继者观察 A 链，等这笔交易足够确定，不会再被回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-07.wav",
   "start": 32.18,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 32.277,
   "speechEnd": 37.07
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "然后把消息和证明，一起送到 B 链。",
   "spoken": "然后把消息和证明，一起送到 B 链。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-08.wav",
   "start": 37.52,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 37.616,
   "speechEnd": 40.539
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "证明可以是一组签名，一条 Merkle 证明，或者一份零知识证明。",
   "spoken": "证明可以是一组签名，一条 Merkle 证明，或者一份零知识证明。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-09.wav",
   "start": 40.94,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 41.039,
   "speechEnd": 45.946
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "B 链的桥合约验证证明，再检查这个序号没有用过。",
   "spoken": "B 链的桥合约验证证明，再检查这个序号没有用过。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-10.wav",
   "start": 46.36,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 46.455,
   "speechEnd": 50.89
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "都通过了，才给用户铸造 100 枚映射 USDT。",
   "spoken": "都通过了，才给用户铸造 100 枚映射 USDT。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-11.wav",
   "start": 51.3,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 51.395,
   "speechEnd": 54.964
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "注意中间这一段。",
   "spoken": "注意中间这一段。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-12.wav",
   "start": 55.36,
   "dur": 1.52,
   "speechStart": 55.36,
   "speechEnd": 56.624
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "从 A 链到 B 链，是信任边界。B 链判断真假，只能靠这一步验证。",
   "spoken": "从 A 链到 B 链，是信任边界。B 链判断真假，只能靠这一步验证。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-13.wav",
   "start": 57.1,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 57.1,
   "speechEnd": 62.778
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "验证要同时查三件事。",
   "spoken": "验证要同时查三件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-14.wav",
   "start": 63.24,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 63.24,
   "speechEnd": 65.669
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "证明是有效的。消息没有被处理过。消息来自正确的源链和源合约。",
   "spoken": "证明是有效的。消息没有被楚理过。消息来自正确的源链和源合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-15.wav",
   "start": 66.1,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 66.1,
   "speechEnd": 71.435
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "打个比方。",
   "spoken": "打个比方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-16.wav",
   "start": 71.84,
   "dur": 0.8,
   "speechStart": 71.94,
   "speechEnd": 72.428
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "A 城的银行收下你的金条，开一张提货单。你拿着它，到 B 城银行兑换等值的金券。",
   "spoken": "A 城的银航收下你的金条，开一张提货单。你拿着它，到 B 城银航兑换等值的金券。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-17.wav",
   "start": 72.86,
   "dur": 7.6,
   "speechStart": 72.96,
   "speechEnd": 80.307
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "B 城银行看不到 A 城的账本，只能看提货单上的签章。",
   "spoken": "B 城银航看不到 A 城的账本，只能看提货单上的签章。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-18.wav",
   "start": 80.68,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 80.779,
   "speechEnd": 85.132
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "印章被偷，或者核对方法有漏洞，B 城银行就会兑出不存在的金子。",
   "spoken": "印章被偷，或者核对方法有漏洞，B 城银航就会兑出不存在的金子。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-19.wav",
   "start": 85.54,
   "dur": 6.16,
   "speechStart": 85.54,
   "speechEnd": 91.475
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-20",
   "text": "比喻不成立的地方是，两座银行的金库加起来，往往是整个系统里最大的一笔钱。",
   "spoken": "比喻不成立的地方是，两座银航的金库加起来，往往是整个系统里最大的一笔钱。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-20.wav",
   "start": 91.92,
   "dur": 6.88,
   "speechStart": 92.012,
   "speechEnd": 98.627
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-21",
   "text": "所以跨链桥，是攻击者的首选目标。",
   "spoken": "所以跨链桥，是攻击者的首选目标。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-21.wav",
   "start": 99.02,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 99.02,
   "speechEnd": 102.272
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-22",
   "text": "反过来走，销毁映射代币、解锁原来的资产，风险一样，金额往往更大。",
   "spoken": "反过来走，销毁映射代币、解锁原来的资产，风险一样，金额往往更大。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-22.wav",
   "start": 102.68,
   "dur": 6.64,
   "speechStart": 102.68,
   "speechEnd": 109.099
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-23",
   "text": "那么，B 链到底该相信谁？",
   "spoken": "那么，B 链到底该相信谁？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg2-23.wav",
   "start": 109.54,
   "dur": 2.72,
   "speechStart": 109.631,
   "speechEnd": 112.045
  }
 ],
